{"id":"aire","lemma":"aire","pos":"noun","rank":4879,"glosses":["(surface) area","a flat surface","direction of the wind"],"ipa":"/ɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a0/Fr-aire.ogg/Fr-aire.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"aires"},"formAudio":{"aires":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-aires.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Calculez l'aire de ce polygone.","en":"Calculate the area of this polygon.","words":[{"g":"to calculate","l":"calculer"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"Je vais m'arrêter à la prochaine aire de repos.","en":"I'm going to stop at the next rest stop.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to stop"},null,null,{"g":"upcoming","l":"prochain"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"rest, ease, repose"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Faisons une halte à la prochaine aire de repos.","en":"Let's stop at the next rest stop.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"halt, pause, break"},null,null,{"g":"upcoming","l":"prochain"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"rest, ease, repose"}],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"L'aire de pique-nique est aisément accessible par la route.","en":"The picnic area is easily accessible by road.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"pike, lance"},{"g":"A small thing."},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"easily"},{"g":"accessible"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"road"}]},{"text":"Ces trois heures au volant m'ont éreinté. Arrêtons-nous à la première aire de repos que nous verrons.","en":"These three hours of driving have worn me out. Let's stop at the first rest area we see.","words":[{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"three"},{"g":"hour, time","l":"heure"},null,null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"exhausted"},{"g":"to stop","l":"arrêter"},{"g":"we / us"},null,null,{"g":"first","l":"premier"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"rest, ease, repose"},{"g"